#. module: conversation_participant_scope
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:conversation_participant_scope.field_mail_conversation_participant__visibility
msgid ""
"Per-participant override of the conversation's external_visibility policy, "
"applied last when computing what an external viewer may see of the "
"participant/CC list."
msgstr ""
"Exception propre au participant à la politique external_visibility de la "
"conversation, appliquée en dernier pour déterminer ce qu'un lecteur externe "
"peut voir de la liste des participants et des Cc."

#. module: conversation_participant_scope
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:conversation_participant_scope.field_mail_conversation_participant__receives_updates
msgid "Receives Updates"
msgstr "Reçoit les mises à jour"

#. module: conversation_participant_scope
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:conversation_participant_scope.field_mail_conversation_participant__receives_updates
msgid ""
"True: an ongoing member of this conversation's audience, included in future "
"outbound recipient computation. False: a one-off CC included on a single "
"message only -- excluded from future recipient computation until promoted "
"(see _promote_to_recipient)."
msgstr ""
"Vrai : membre permanent de l'audience de cette conversation, inclus dans le "
"calcul des destinataires des envois futurs. Faux : Cc ponctuel inclus sur un"
" seul message, exclu du calcul des destinataires futurs tant qu'il n'est pas"
" promu (voir _promote_to_recipient)."

